-- 0185: aṣl from every book, batch 07 — each book's own statement (read by its profile; Lane in English), verbatim
-- with block + page and a plain English line; primary = the meaning most books share. Quotes checked against blocks.
-- aslmb_07: aṣl per book for 25 roots that rested on Ibn Fāris alone (AGR:VOC:002/017).
-- Each row: the book's own words as printed + block + page + entry. ONE primary per root, by the reading most books share
-- (tie -> the earliest book). Standalone: INSERT OR IGNORE + guarded UPDATEs; safe to re-run. No row deleted.
-- خبط
